# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Raster fixtures are binary. `text=auto` above would detect this correctly on its
# own — a GeoTIFF is full of NUL bytes — but detection is not something to leave to
# inference when the failure mode is a silently LF-normalised binary that no longer
# opens. State it.
*.tif binary
*.tiff binary

# A .tfd design file is a zip. Same reasoning, and the consequence is worse: a
# mangled zip does not open at all. None is tracked today; this is here so that
# committing one cannot go wrong quietly.
*.tfd binary
